| Article Count (raw & relative)                 |
| Language Tone (negative vs positive)           |
| Language Polarity (emotionality)               |
| Language Activity (vs passivity)               |
| Social Media Embeddings (count)                |
| World Length (avg & bucket counts)             |
:::

